# The image builds only ngstoned, so the context is an allowlist: everything
# is excluded (.git, landing, e2e, docs, deploy, bin, node_modules, .env
# files, editor and agent config) except the Go module and its sources.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal

# Tests are not compiled into the binary; leaving them out keeps test-only
# edits from invalidating the build cache.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
